-- COMMIT TRANSACTION here, ROLLBACK TRANSACTION there. Run the preflight first.
--
-- WHAT THIS ADDS, through the installed writer model.mint_content_artifact (re-running is harmless):
--   the source OV3 installs (CREATE OR ALTER PROCEDURE analysis.check_capability_feature_conformance), retained under sha256:e1afc4f75e34b69e32b605a553235e5abcc78a22997b12ac8b545d995615adfe;
--   the bytes of features/check-capability-feature-conformance.feature, retained under sha256:49bf06230349e792eeba7041a7f7ecf2cd2c894aa5635ae2ec5c5b2130ab02b9: the
